  },
  "b2": {
   "text": "The Unfortunate Splash: A cracked jug gives way, soaking (Strongman). The crowd roars with laughter; the organizers replace the jug and offer a fair retry.",
   "src": "L9658-9660",
   "children": [
    {
     "next": "coda"
    }
   ]
  },
  "b3": {
   "text": "The Surprise Winner: A quiet villager with excellent balance defeats several boastful competitors. (Strongman) learns that control matters as much as brute force.",
   "src": "L9661-9663",
   "children": [
    {
     "next": "coda"
    }
   ]
  },
  "b4": {
   "text": "A Sensible Withdrawal: (Strongman) notices a strained grip and stops before injury. No prize, but an elder praises good judgment.",
   "src": "L9664-9665",
   "children": [
    {
     "next": "coda"
    }
   ],
   "text_only": [
